.TH std::copyable_function::operatorbool 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::copyable_function::operatorbool \- std::copyable_function::operatorbool

.SH Synopsis
explicit operator bool() const noexcept;  (since C++26)

Checks whether *this stores a callable target, i.e. is not empty.

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

true if *this stores a callable target, false otherwise.

